              {
                "dsDescriptionValue": {
                  "typeName": "dsDescriptionValue",
                  "multiple": false,
                  "typeClass": "primitive",
                  "value": "<p>This study is about 'hard' and 'soft' informative television advertisement. 784 Dutch adolescents evaluated ten spots about safe sex, road safety and smoking.</p>"
                }
              },
              {
                "dsDescriptionValue": {
                  "typeName": "dsDescriptionValue",
                  "multiple": false,
                  "typeClass": "primitive",
                  "value": "<p>The two video sets (wmv; mpg) are identical. The spots were presented during a school lesson. The sequence of the spots were randomized in the experiment. The contents of the video is also described in the appendix of the file: KNOBHOUT1996.PDF</p>"
                }
              }
            ]
